# Workspace-baseline .gitignore — rename to `.gitignore` when copying.
# v2 — 2026-11-14
# PRIVATE repos ignore only sensitive data (secrets, personal or message data)
# and the machine junk below; never a file the project needs to work or resume
# (CHECKPOINT.md, CLAUDE.md, specs, docs).

# ---- Editor / OS noise ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# ---- Common landmines ----
node_modules/
*.log
.env
.env.*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
dist/
build/

# ---- Cloud-sync transients (Google Drive / OneDrive / Dropbox) ----
.tmp.*
.tmp.drivedownload/
.tmp.driveupload/

# ---- Harness state ----
# CHECKPOINT.md is TRACKED in private repos: it is the resume state, so a
# fresh clone (another machine, a cloud sandbox) can pick up where you left off.
# Public repos only: uncomment the next line.
# CHECKPOINT.md
